      "raw_text": "[7:15p.m.] #IkoroduRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good as you descend the Dorman Long Bridge to Fadeyi, Onipan, Palmgrove approaching Obanikoro where it starts getting slow inwards Anthony, Idiroko, Independence Tunnel, Odo Iyalaro to New Garage and Ojota Bus stop due to high influx of vehicles.\n\nMen strategically positioned to ensure traffic is good.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
